1
00:00:00,740 --> 00:00:02,910
(Sheldon:)-But you don't even know...
-Doesn't matter.

2
00:00:03,042 --> 00:00:05,612
-But, now, but in my defense--
-Doesn't matter.

3
00:00:05,711 --> 00:00:07,781
(Sheldon:)You're not listening
to my side of it.

4
00:00:07,913 --> 00:00:10,083
(Penny:)Okay, fine, Sheldon.
What is your side?

5
00:00:11,083 --> 00:00:12,063
(Sheldon:)Well--

6
00:00:12,118 --> 00:00:14,458
(Penny:)Nope, got to go with Amy on this one.

7
00:00:19,925 --> 00:00:21,735
The shrimp was spicy.

8
00:00:21,794 --> 00:00:23,204
You want a TUNIS?

9
00:00:23,262 --> 00:00:24,602
(Howard:)You got the tropical fruit kind?

10
00:00:24,697 --> 00:00:26,807
(Raj:)No, if I buy those,
I just go through them like candy.

11
00:00:26,932 --> 00:00:30,612
(Howard:)Tell me about it. One time, I swear
I pooped out a stick of chalk.

12
00:00:33,305 --> 00:00:35,145
(Howard:)-I'll get it.
-Thanks.

13
00:00:37,643 --> 00:00:39,553
(Penny:)-Hi.
-Hi.

14
00:00:39,578 --> 00:00:41,648
(Bernadette:)I may have overreacted.

15
00:00:41,714 --> 00:00:45,454
(Howard:)Well, I didn't handle it
so great, either.

16
00:00:45,551 --> 00:00:48,161
(Bernadette:)It's just sometimes I feel like
you enjoy spending time

17
00:00:48,220 --> 00:00:49,790
(Bernadette:)with your friends more than with me.

18
00:00:49,922 --> 00:00:51,802
(Howard:)-That's not true.
-It's not?

19
00:00:51,891 --> 00:00:53,631
(Bernadette:)You spend all day together at work,

20
00:00:53,759 --> 00:00:55,569
(Bernadette:)and then you all hang out at night
playing games,

21
00:00:55,661 --> 00:00:57,231
(Bernadette:)going to the comic book store.

22
00:00:57,263 --> 00:01:02,023
(Bernadette:)Last week, you two got
8 couples massage.

